context:
DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/v2/priority-intelligence/{priority_id}
Soft-deletes a PIR. The PIR will no longer count against quota.
Required: account_id (path); priority_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/v2/priority-intelligence/interests/{interest_id}
Deletes a structured account interest so later Priority Intelligence Option 2 evaluations no longer include it.
Required: account_id (path); interest_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/v2/priority-intelligence/{priority_id}
Returns a single free-form Priority Intelligence Requirement for the authenticated account.
Required: account_id (path); priority_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/v2/priority-intelligence/interests/backtests/{backtest_id}
Returns a previously completed account-interest backtest by ID. The backtest must belong to this account.
Required: account_id (path); backtest_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/v2/priority-intelligence/interests/evaluations/{evaluation_id}
Returns a previously completed live account-interest evaluation by ID. The evaluation must belong to this account.
Required: account_id (path); evaluation_id (path)
